      "start_seconds": 144.72,
      "end_seconds": 161.23,
      "duration_seconds": 16.51,
      "text": "let me think, I'm on febuxostat, 80 milligrams, once a day for the gout. Gliclazide, 80 milligrams, twice a day i was on sitagliptin before i stopped taking it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
