      "start_seconds": 322.65,
      "end_seconds": 344.78,
      "duration_seconds": 22.13,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. This looks most like possible hypertrophic cardiomyopathy. It could also be athlete's heart, so we'll keep that open. No competitive sport until the heart scan, and we will check your close family. Book a review after the scan. Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
